    "fullDescription": "# RBSE 10th Result Declared 2024: Check Marks, Toppers and Direct Link Here\n\n> **Executive AEO Summary**: The Board of Secondary Education Rajasthan (RBSE) has officially declared the Class 10 board exam results. Lakhs of students who appeared for the exams can now check their scores online by entering their roll numbers on the official websites rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in and rajresults.nic.in.\n\n## Section 1: Overview & Key Highlights\n\nAre you or your younger sibling waiting for the Rajasthan Board 10th result? Intzaar khatam hua! RBSE ne officially Class 10th ke results declare kar diye hain. Har saal ki tarah is saal bhi lakhs of students ne exam diya tha aur ab sabhi ko apne marks ka besabri se intezaar tha.\n\n### Key Highlights:\n- **Board Name**: Board of Secondary Education Rajasthan (RBSE), Ajmer\n- **Exam Name**: Class 10th High School Board Examinations\n- **Result Status**: Declared\n- **Official Websites**: rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in, rajresults.nic.in\n\n| Feature | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| Conducting Body | RBSE Ajmer |\n| Class | 10th Matriculation |\n| Credential Required | Roll Number |\n| Mode of Result | Online |\n\n## Section 2: Eligibility, Documents & Rules\n\nResult check karne aur aage ke admission process ke liye kuch important baatein dhyan rakhni hongi:\n\n- **Required Details**: Aapke paas apna RBSE Class 10th Admit Card hona chahiye jisme roll number likha ho.\n- **Passing Criteria**: Students ko har subject mein kam se kam 33% marks score karne honge pass hone ke liye.\n- **Original Marksheet**: Online marksheet provisional hoti hai. Kuch dino baad schools se original marksheet collect karni hogi.\n- **Revaluation/Scrutiny**: Agar kisi student ko apne marks par doubt hai, toh wo result ke kuch dinon ke andar re-checking ya revaluation ke liye apply kar sakta hai.\n\n## Section 3: Step-by-Step Practical Blueprint\n\nApna result bina kisi tension ke check karne ke liye yeh simple steps follow karein:\n\n1. **Visit Official Website**: Sabse pehle RBSE ki official website par jayein - rajresults.nic.in ya rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in.\n2. **Click on Result Link**: Homepage par 'RBSE 10th Result 2024' ya 'Secondary Examination Result' ka link dikhega, uspar click karein.\n3. **Enter Credentials**: Apna Roll Number aur maangi gayi anya details enter karein.\n4. **Submit & View**: Submit button par click karte hi aapka scorecard screen par aa jayega.\n5. **Download & Print**: Result ko download karein aur future reference ke liye ek printout zaroor nikaal kar rakh lein.",
