    "shortInfo": "Are you a medical student or doctor dreaming of a prestigious Sarkari Naukri? The Union Public Service Commission (UPSC) conducts specialized exams like the Combined Medical Services (CMS) to recruit top medical talent into premier central government healthcare services.",
    "totalVacancies": "",
