    "fullDescription": "# RBSE 10th Result Declared 2024: Check Marks, Direct Links & Pass Percentage\n\n> **Executive AEO Summary**: The Board of Secondary Education Rajasthan (RBSE) has officially declared the Class 10th results. Students can check their scores, subject-wise marks, and download their provisional marksheets online using their roll number.\n\n## Section 1: Overview & Key Highlights\n\nAre you or someone in your family waiting for the **RBSE 10th Result**? The wait is finally over! Rajasthan Board ne Class 10th ke results declare kar diye hain. Lakhon students jo apne exams ke baad se tense the, ab apna score card easily check kar sakte hain. \n\nIdhar hum aapko sabse fast aur easy tareeqe se result check karne ki puri jankari de rahe hain. Is saal bhi girls ne performance mein badhiya koshish ki hai, aur overall pass percentage kaafi encouraging raha hai.\n\n| Feature | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| Board Name | Board of Secondary Education Rajasthan (RBSE) |\n| Exam Name | Class 10th High School Examination |\n| Result Status | Declared |\n| Official Websites | rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in / rajresults.nic.in |\n| Credentials Required | Roll Number |\n\n## Section 2: Eligibility, Documents & Rules\n\nResult check karne aur aage ke admission process ke liye kuch zaroori baaton ka dhyaan rakhna bohot zaroori hai:\n\n- **Roll Number:** Aapka admit card paas hona chahiye jisme roll number likha ho.\n- **Provisional Marksheet:** Online jo result aayega wo provisional hoga. Original marksheet aapke school se kuch dinon baad milegi.\n- **Passing Criteria:** Students ko har subject mein minimum 33% marks laane hote hain pass hone ke liye.\n- **Revaluation/Rechecking:** Agar aap apne marks se khush nahi hain, toh board re-totaling ya re-evaluation ke liye jaldi hi application windows open karega.\n\n## Section 3: Step-by-Step Practical Blueprint\n\nApna RBSE 10th Result bina kisi pareshani ke check karne ke liye yeh steps follow karein:\n\n1. **Visit Official Website:** Sabse pehle RBSE ki official website par jayein (rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in ya rajresults.nic.in).\n2. **Click on Result Link:** Homepage par 'RBSE Class 10th Result 2024' ya similar link par click karein.\n3. **Enter Credentials:** Apna Roll Number aur maangi gayi details enter karein.\n4. **Submit & View:** Submit button dabate hi aapka scorecard screen par aa jayega.\n5. **Download & Print:** Future reference ke liye marksheet ko download karke printout nikal kar rakh lein.\n\nAll the best to all the students! Agar result acha aaye toh celebrate karein, aur agar ummeed se kam aaye toh himmat na haarein—yeh sirf ek exam ka result hai, life ka nahi.",
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How can I check my RBSE 10th Result?",
        "answer": "You can check your RBSE Class 10th result by visiting the official website rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in or rajresults.nic.in using your roll number."
      },
      {
        "question": "What details are required to view the Rajasthan Board 10th result?",
        "answer": "You only need your Roll Number as mentioned on your RBSE Class 10 admit card to check the result online."
      },
      {
        "question": "Is the online downloaded marksheet valid for admissions?",
        "answer": "Yes, the online provisional marksheet is generally accepted for initial admission processes to Class 11, but you must collect the original marksheet from your school later."
      },
      {
        "question": "What is the passing marks criteria for RBSE Class 10 exams?",
        "answer": "Students must secure a minimum of 33% marks in each individual subject as well as in aggregate to be declared pass by the Rajasthan Board."
      },
      {
        "question": "What should I do if I am not satisfied with my RBSE 10th marks?",
        "answer": "If you are unhappy with your scores, you can apply for revaluation or rechecking of your answer sheets through the official RBSE portal once the board releases the notification."
      }
    ],
