    "fullDescription": "# SSC GD Constable 2026 Exam Pattern & Syllabus PDF\n\nStaff Selection Commission has specified the **Official CBT Exam Pattern & Syllabus for SSC GD Constable Recruitment 2026**.\n\n## CBT Exam Pattern Highlights\n- **Total Questions:** 80 Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs)\n- **Total Marks:** 160 Marks (2 Marks per question)\n- **Duration:** 60 Minutes (1 Hour)\n- **Negative Marking:** 0.25 Marks deducted for every wrong answer\n\n### Subject Breakdown\n1. **General Intelligence & Reasoning:** 20 Questions (40 Marks)\n2. **General Knowledge & General Awareness:** 20 Questions (40 Marks)\n3. **Elementary Mathematics:** 20 Questions (40 Marks)\n4. **English or Hindi:** 20 Questions (40 Marks)",
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "Is there negative marking in SSC GD Constable exam?",
        "answer": "Yes, there is 0.25 negative marking for each incorrect answer."
      }
    ],
