    "shortInfo": "Searching for top government job options after MBBS? UPSC conducts exams like Combined Medical Services (CMS) and direct recruitments for Medical Officer posts in Central Healthcare Services, Railways, and Municipal Corporations. Read this complete guide to understand eligibility, exam pattern, and preparation strategy.",
    "totalVacancies": "",
    "qualificationRequired": [],
