    "shortInfo": "The Board of Secondary Education, Rajasthan (BSER) has officially announced the RBSE Class 10th Result. Students can now check their marks and download their scorecards online using their roll number on the official website rajeduboard.rajasthan.gov.in. Here is your complete guide on how to check your scorecard, apply for re-evaluation, and get original marksheets.",
