    "shortInfo": "Rajasthan Board of Secondary Education (RBSE) has officially declared the Class 10th Board results. Students can easily check their scorecard online using their roll number on the official portals. Detailed instructions for supplementary exams and re-evaluation are also available.",
    "totalVacancies": "",
