    "shortInfo": "Pradhan Mantri Jan Dhan Yojana (PMJDY) 2026 allows every Indian citizen to open a zero balance savings account with built-in insurance and overdraft benefits. You get a free RuPay debit card along with Rs 2 Lakh accidental insurance cover and easy access to direct benefit transfers (DBT). Read our complete guide to open your PMJDY account smoothly today.",
