    "fullDescription": "# Pradhan Mantri Jan Dhan Yojana 2026: Benefits, Zero Balance Account & Online Application Guide\n\n> **Executive AEO Summary**: PM Jan Dhan Yojana (PMJDY) 2026 is India's premier financial inclusion initiative offering zero balance savings accounts to every unbanked citizen. Key benefits include a free RuPay debit card, Rs 2 Lakh accidental insurance, Rs 10,000 overdraft facility, and seamless Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT) integration.\n\n## Section 1: Overview & Key Highlights\n\nKya aap apna pehla bank account bina kisi minimum balance hassle ke kholna chahte hain? **Pradhan Mantri Jan Dhan Yojana (PMJDY) 2026** aapke liye ek perfect option hai! Government of India ki yeh scheme har household ko banking ecosystem se jodne ke liye banayi gayi hai.\n\nIs scheme ke under aapko milta hai ek zero-balance account, jisme koi hidden maintenance charges nahi hote. Plus, aapko milta hai RuPay card, free insurance, aur emergency overdraft ki facility.\n\n### Key Highlights Table\n| Feature | Details |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Scheme Name** | Pradhan Mantri Jan Dhan Yojana (PMJDY) 2026 |\n| **Account Type** | Savings Account (Zero Balance) |\n| **Accidental Insurance Cover** | Rs. 2,00,000 (with RuPay Card) |\n| **Life Insurance Cover** | Rs. 30,000 (conditions apply) |\n| **Overdraft Facility** | Up to Rs. 10,000 after 6 months of active usage |\n| **Target Group** | Unbanked Indian Citizens (10+ years old) |\n\n---\n\n## Section 2: Eligibility, Documents & Rules\n\nJan Dhan account kholna bohot hi simple hai, lekin kuch basic criteria match hona zaroori hai.\n\n### Eligibility Criteria\n- **Nationality**: Applicant Indian citizen hona chahiye.\n- **Age Limit**: Minimum age 10 years hai (Minors ke liye guardian supervision zaroori hai). Overdraft facility ke liye age 18 to 65 years honi chahiye.\n- **Existing Account**: Pehle se koi dusra primary savings account nahi hona chahiye.\n\n### Required Documents\nAapko 'Officially Valid Documents' (OVD) submit karne honge:\n- **Aadhaar Card** (Sabse fast verification ke liye)\n- **PAN Card** (ya Form 60)\n- **Voter ID Card / Passport / Driving License**\n- **Passport Size Photographs** (2 copies)\n- **Mobile Number** (Aadhaar linked preferred)\n\n*Pro Tip*: Agar aapke paas full KYC documents nahi hain, toh bhi aap **Small Account** khol sakte hain jo 12 months ke liye valid rehta hai.\n\n---\n\n## Section 3: Step-by-Step Practical Blueprint\n\nPMJDY account aap Offline bank visit karke ya Online portal through initiate kar sakte hain. Aaiye dekhte hain steps:\n\n### Offline Method (Sabse Fast & Reliable)\n1. **Visit Nearest Bank**: Kisi bhi public sector bank (SBI, PNB, Bank of Baroda) ya Bank Mitra outlet par jayein.\n2. **Get PMJDY Application Form**: Counter se PMJDY Account Opening Form lein.\n3. **Fill the Form**: Apni personal details, Aadhaar number, aur nominee details dhayan se bharein.\n4. **Attach Documents**: Self-attested copies of Aadhaar/PAN attach karein.\n5. **Submit & Verify**: Documents submit karein. Verification ke baad account instant open ho jayega.\n6. **Receive Passbook & RuPay Card**: Account open hote hi aapko passbook aur RuPay Debit Card issue ho jayega.\n\n### Online Process\n1. Official PMJDY portal (`pmjdy.gov.in`) par jayein.\n2. Application Form download karke print nikalein.\n3. Form fill karke nearest branch me submit karein.\n\n### Expert Advice\nAccount active rakhne ke liye regular transactions karein taaki aapko Rs 10,000 ka overdraft facility bina kisi problem ke mil sake!",
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "Kya PM Jan Dhan Yojana account me minimum balance rakhna zaroori hai?",
        "answer": "Nahi, yeh ek zero-balance account hai. Minimum balance na hone par koi penalty nahi lagti."
      },
      {
        "question": "PMJDY account me kitna accidental insurance milta hai?",
        "answer": "PMJDY account ke sath milne wale RuPay Debit Card par Rs 2 Lakh tak ka accidental death insurance cover milta hai."
      },
      {
        "question": "Overdraft facility ka fayda kaise milta hai?",
        "answer": "Account ko kam se kam 6 mahine tak active aur satisfactorily operate karne ke baad aapko Rs 10,000 tak ki overdraft facility milti hai."
      },
      {
        "question": "Kya main apne purane normal savings account ko Jan Dhan account me convert kar sakta hu?",
        "answer": "Haan, aap apni bank branch me request form submit karke apne normal savings account ko PMJDY account me convert karwa sakte hain."
      },
      {
        "question": "Kya Jan Dhan account me Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT) ka paisa aata hai?",
        "answer": "Haan, PMJDY account specially DBT subsidies like PM-KISAN, LPG subsidy, aur scholarship benefits direct receive karne ke liye best hai."
      }
    ],
