    "date": "11 August 2026",
    "category": "Sports",
    "summary": "The Indian athletics contingent finished at the top of the medal standings at the 26th Asian Athletics Championships in Bangkok, clinching a total of 29 medals, including 12 Gold, 9 Silver, and 8 Bronze.",
